   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello, <div><br></div><div> I&#39;m a newbie in jQuery (and html). </div><div><br></div><div> Here is one of my first tests of jQuery : <a href=\"http://pagist.info/9007180\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://pagist.info/9007180&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404803450000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ED87LA2GYH29-BbaJPgVK\">http://pagist.info/9007180</a> (code: <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/stla/9007180\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/stla/9007180&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792404803450000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1jiLIqoueaa7jJoSdqELcC\">https://gist.github.com/stla/9007180</a>)</div><div><br></div><div>The animation is activated when the user push the button <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.799999237060547px;white-space:pre\">#btn1</span>:</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.799999237060547px;width:854px;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><div>  <span>$</span><span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;#btn1&quot;</span><span>).</span><span>click</span><span>(</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">function</span><span>(){</span></div><div>    <span>$</span><span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;#box&quot;</span><span>).</span><span>animate</span><span>({</span><span>width</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;300px&quot;</span><span>});</span></div><div>    <span>$</span><span>(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;#box&quot;</span><span>).</span><span>animate</span><span>({</span><span>height</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;300px&quot;</span><span>});</span></div><div>  <span>});</span></div></pre></div><div><br></div><div> Now, imagine for example I define a <i>true/false</i> reactive variable in the server.R file of a shiny app, by doing :</div><div><br></div><div><div><i>  output$sleep &lt;- reactive({</i></div><div><i>    Sys.sleep(4)</i></div><div><i>    return(TRUE)</i></div><div><i>  })</i></div><div><i>  outputOptions(output, &#39;sleep&#39;, suspendWhenHidden=FALSE)</i></div></div><div><i><br></i></div><div>What  is the code<span style=\"font-size:13px\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I should use instead </span><span style=\"font-size:13px\">of the event </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.799999237060547px;white-space:pre\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.799999237060547px;white-space:pre\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.799999237060547px;white-space:pre;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;#btn1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.799999237060547px;white-space:pre\">).</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.799999237060547px;white-space:pre\">click</span><span style=\"font-size:13px\">  in order that the animation is activated when <i>output.sleep</i> is <i>true</i> ?</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><br></span></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
